<title>MEXICO: TENNIS-MEXICO V ARGENTINA DAVIS CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEXICO V ARGENTINA DAVIS CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of reverse singles in the Davis Cup tennis World Group qualifying tie between Mexico and Argentina on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results (Mexico names first):</p>
<p>Alejandro Hernandez beat Hernan Gumy 6-4 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Mexico take unbeatable 3-1 lead over Argentina.  </p>
<p>Leonardo Lavalle lost to Gaston Etlis 6-3 3-6 (Lavalle retired hurt)</p>
<p>Mexico won tie 3-2.</p>
</text>
